    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276494</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仕事を請けますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Will you take the job?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274684</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、あーたたち……
まんまとやってくれたザマスわね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I say, it's you again.
You did do some fine work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何のことだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do you mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274792</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何のことって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do I mean...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでも、あーたたち、
不思議な力を持ってて、
それで仕事してるとか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, anyway, you seem to
have some strange powers,
and use them for work, yes?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひとつ、あたしも
頼めないザマスかね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I'd like you to do
something for me, as well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、ゴメンだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, miss me with that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おや、あたしの言うことは
聞けないということザマスか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I say, you're refusing
to even hear me out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>話だけでも
聞かせてもらいます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, if you could
just tell us a little.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;！　なんでだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell, &lt;Mel&gt;!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275456</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはそれ、
これはこれだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That was that, and this is this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>切り替えの早い子は
好きザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I do prefer children who
can understand the difference.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その代わり、借金を
取ってこいとか、そういう
のだったらお断りします</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But in return, there are some
rules. We won't collect on
any loans, for example.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーたたちみたいな子どもに
そんなこと頼まないザマス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I'd never ask children like
you to do something like that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ&lt;White&gt;に忘れたバッグを
取ってくるザマスよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I forgot my bag in
&lt;Red&gt;Valhalla&lt;White&gt;. Get it for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれがないと、
商売ができなくて、
すこぶる困るザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, without that, I can't
do any business. It's
extraordinarily troublesome.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。
行ってくる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Got it. We'll be back soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい子ザマスね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Such good kids, I say.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バッグは道具屋に
忘れたと思うザマス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, I left my bag
in the item shop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり、こんなヤツの
言うことなんて聞きたくね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, y'know what? No way in hell
am I "hearing out" a guy like him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうザマスか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see, I say.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>別にあーたたちが
やってくれないなら他に
頼むからいいザマスけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I say, if you won't do it,
I'll have someone else
take care of it, instead.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。
行ってくる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Got it. We'll be back soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい子ザマスね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Such good kids, I say.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
